## Summary
Coursera is launching a pilot of Admin AI, an agentic experience designed for conversational analytics to help learning leaders analyze data more efficiently. The tool aims to reduce the burden of manual data analysis and facilitate better decision-making.

## Key Points
- Admin AI pilot is launched by Coursera.
- It is a purpose-built agentic experience for conversational analytics.
- Designed to reduce manual data analysis efforts for learning leaders.
- Helps transition from data to informed decisions in learning contexts.


